{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Rare Cards</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs to find exciting and powerful cards. Complete your sets or trade duplicates with others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/cdc89b0f2a7eff04e5b53229ace7a965.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/cdc89b0f2a7eff04e5b53229ace7a965.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/cdc89b0f2a7eff04e5b53229ace7a965.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET KAREN. KICK KAREN.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/6d4d246fa41e2228a50ee9c6efdd5268.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/6d4d246fa41e2228a50ee9c6efdd5268.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/6d4d246fa41e2228a50ee9c6efdd5268.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-Op Multiplayer Card Shop Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer First</strong> You are not alone. Play with friends or meet other players online. Trade cards, help each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/394dffef5ee0a2cb79e03547f5f4e002.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/394dffef5ee0a2cb79e03547f5f4e002.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/394dffef5ee0a2cb79e03547f5f4e002.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vending Machines Across the City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Place vending machines in smart spots around the city. Sell cards even when you are offline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Build and Manage Your Card Shop</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your shelves with booster packs. Choose the best prices and make sure customers find what they want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/c8a39f0a8362f98e5d5f7833823b38b7.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/c8a39f0a8362f98e5d5f7833823b38b7.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/c8a39f0a8362f98e5d5f7833823b38b7.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steam Inventory Support &amp; Card Drop Rates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each card you collect becomes part of your Steam Inventory. You can view, trade, or sell cards using Steam Marketplace (if enabled). Every booster pack includes 8 cards. Here are the chances for each card rarity per slot:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common: 70% chance (about 5.6 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon: 20% chance (about 1.6 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare: 7% chance (about 0.56 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic: 2% chance (about 0.16 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary: 0.9% chance (about 0.072 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Rare: 0.1% chance (about 0.008 cards per pack)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Shop System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also run an online store! Accept orders, ship products, and grow your fanbase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/7b8e19cb51a70016328bd68c13be0fa5.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/7b8e19cb51a70016328bd68c13be0fa5.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/7b8e19cb51a70016328bd68c13be0fa5.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Customize Your Store</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Decorate your space, and unlock new furniture and features. Grow your little shop into a true card empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add posters, signs, shelves, furniture\u2014make your shop look just the way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/8dcc23e7df5c7eff93b7b65ef82b7932.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/8dcc23e7df5c7eff93b7b65ef82b7932.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/8dcc23e7df5c7eff93b7b65ef82b7932.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR DREAM TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hire staff, manage your crew, expand your store.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/d58ad6b9c0f2f63fa5de405cd9d322a3.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/d58ad6b9c0f2f63fa5de405cd9d322a3.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/d58ad6b9c0f2f63fa5de405cd9d322a3.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARD TOURNAMENT TABLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Host tournaments, earn money &amp; XP, and unlock bigger competitions as your shop grows.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/2138f5c4b5bad2c9a226561a3daf7da3.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/2138f5c4b5bad2c9a226561a3daf7da3.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/2138f5c4b5bad2c9a226561a3daf7da3.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALKAMON EGGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Craft rare monster eggs, collect them or sell for profit.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/d065dbbcb1b4282ad7d206363d41d91a.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/d065dbbcb1b4282ad7d206363d41d91a.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/d065dbbcb1b4282ad7d206363d41d91a.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3354260/d30dc0b0a175baafb799e5af12d0f882af2a452c.jpg"},{"name":"Negotiate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3354260/b2f9a85d8828593ec488aaf01ee08d45fd5ff6a5.jpg"},{"name":"Tokyo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3354260/a20889737100773fa4523bcc960743225892090c.jpg"},{"name":"First Reveal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3354260/d7b1f3977578aa2e115f21977e2f4b6377d1c8b4.jpg"},{"name":"First Rare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3354260/03ba3d6c9c56cd6eb1a15cb97ba2cccb516123e6.jpg"},{"name":"Climber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3354260/ad9da06894610a5851297a19c0c1726f5f59c9f0.jpg"},{"name":"Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3354260/8bf21b99943f1b03984c1d4b8928a104dfcb17ed.jpg"},{"name":"Level 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3354260/ba591bd84188558138fcebb925313741664dfe09.jpg"},{"name":"Level 15","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3354260/c34af7110ff1a439b71afac6d0c9cd4b5495209d.jpg"},{"name":"Level 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3354260/7c34aaa126d1efd281a04cc3aa1cb66c10995df5.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3354260?t=1771769487","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/2015dc9d7f0a1653831e623e335088be68a47ba9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771769487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/4d904a38f94107323c241826b402c7cd2300b9c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771769487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/4d904a38f94107323c241826b402c7cd2300b9c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771769487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Rare Cards</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs to find exciting and powerful cards. Complete your sets or trade duplicates with others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/cdc89b0f2a7eff04e5b53229ace7a965.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/cdc89b0f2a7eff04e5b53229ace7a965.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/cdc89b0f2a7eff04e5b53229ace7a965.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET KAREN. KICK KAREN.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/6d4d246fa41e2228a50ee9c6efdd5268.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/6d4d246fa41e2228a50ee9c6efdd5268.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/6d4d246fa41e2228a50ee9c6efdd5268.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-Op Multiplayer Card Shop Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer First</strong> You are not alone. Play with friends or meet other players online. Trade cards, help each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/394dffef5ee0a2cb79e03547f5f4e002.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/394dffef5ee0a2cb79e03547f5f4e002.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/394dffef5ee0a2cb79e03547f5f4e002.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vending Machines Across the City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Place vending machines in smart spots around the city. Sell cards even when you are offline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Build and Manage Your Card Shop</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your shelves with booster packs. Choose the best prices and make sure customers find what they want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/c8a39f0a8362f98e5d5f7833823b38b7.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/c8a39f0a8362f98e5d5f7833823b38b7.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/c8a39f0a8362f98e5d5f7833823b38b7.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steam Inventory Support &amp; Card Drop Rates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each card you collect becomes part of your Steam Inventory. You can view, trade, or sell cards using Steam Marketplace (if enabled). Every booster pack includes 8 cards. Here are the chances for each card rarity per slot:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common: 70% chance (about 5.6 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon: 20% chance (about 1.6 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare: 7% chance (about 0.56 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic: 2% chance (about 0.16 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary: 0.9% chance (about 0.072 cards per pack)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Rare: 0.1% chance (about 0.008 cards per pack)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Shop System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also run an online store! Accept orders, ship products, and grow your fanbase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/7b8e19cb51a70016328bd68c13be0fa5.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/7b8e19cb51a70016328bd68c13be0fa5.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/7b8e19cb51a70016328bd68c13be0fa5.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Customize Your Store</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Decorate your space, and unlock new furniture and features. Grow your little shop into a true card empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add posters, signs, shelves, furniture\u2014make your shop look just the way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/8dcc23e7df5c7eff93b7b65ef82b7932.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/8dcc23e7df5c7eff93b7b65ef82b7932.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/8dcc23e7df5c7eff93b7b65ef82b7932.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR DREAM TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hire staff, manage your crew, expand your store.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/d58ad6b9c0f2f63fa5de405cd9d322a3.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/d58ad6b9c0f2f63fa5de405cd9d322a3.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/d58ad6b9c0f2f63fa5de405cd9d322a3.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARD TOURNAMENT TABLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Host tournaments, earn money &amp; XP, and unlock bigger competitions as your shop grows.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/2138f5c4b5bad2c9a226561a3daf7da3.poster.avif?t=1771769487\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/2138f5c4b5bad2c9a226561a3daf7da3.webm?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354260/extras/2138f5c4b5bad2c9a226561a3daf7da3.mp4?t=1771769487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALKAMON EGGS</strong></h2><p 